# ⚖️ Justice in Judgment: Unveiling Hidden Bias in LLM-assisted Peer Reviews

[![ACL'26](https://img.shields.io/badge/ACL-2026%20Findings-blue)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.13400)
[![arXiv](https://img.shields.io/badge/arXiv-2509.13400-red)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.13400)
[![Python 3.8+](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.8+-green)](https://www.python.org/)

## 📋 About

This repository is for *Justice in Judgment: Unveiling Hidden Bias in LLM-assisted Peer Reviews* ([ACL'26 Findings](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.13400)).

It contains the prompting and inference code, experiment configuration files, and released review outputs used to evaluate bias in LLM-assisted peer reviews across key dimensions: **affiliation/prestige**, **seniority**, and **publication history**.

**What's Included:**

- 📑 Paper IDs used in experiments: [data/paper_ids_used.csv](data/paper_ids_used.csv)
- 📊 Paper metadata by ID: [data/iclr2025_metadata_by_id.json](data/iclr2025_metadata_by_id.json)
- 💾 Model outputs and grouped review results: [results/](results/)

---

